eating-in-HydroElectric-Generators-to-Increase-Output","stars":1,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Efficiency of modern hydroelectric generator designs can be increased by using induction heating within penstocks and hydro turbines to boil and expand inlet water. The hydroturbine's electricity generation capabilities would power the induction heating surfaces to boiling temperatures. As the water reaches boiling temperatures as it drops from the penstock into the hydro turbine, it's expansion would increase the turbine speed at much greater velocities that the water would without expansion. This design is something that was developed from turbochargers used in automobiles.","topics":[],"score":212866,"global_rank":259647},{"name":"ikangiec/To-Do-List","owner":"ikangiec","html_url":"https://github.com/ikangiec/To-Do-List","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"A simple functional to-do-list app","topics":[],"score":212861,"global_rank":259649},{"name":"prashanth08/PortScanDetector","owner":"prashanth08","html_url":"https://github.com/prashanth08/PortScanDetector","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Built a network port scan detector in C, to identify various TCP port scan attacks.","topics":[],"score":212861,"global_rank":259650},{"name":"map34/simple_tftp","owner":"map34","html_url":"https://github.com/map34/simple_tftp","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"A simple in-memory TFTP server written in Golang.","topics":["cli","golang","tftp-server"],"score":212859,"global_rank":259655},{"name":"djpmsft/synapse","owner":"djpmsft","html_url":"https://github.com/djpmsft/synapse","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212859,"global_rank":259656},{"name":"powelldev/android-dice-roller","owner":"powelldev","html_url":"https://github.com/powelldev/android-dice-roller